 "notes": "Alto saxophone, straight tone, forte layer, clean condenser mic, mono. 12 notes C#3-G#5 every minor third (one whole step at the top); A#3 uses round-robin 2 because round-robin 1 has no loopable stretch. Every file has a seamless sustain loop. Vibrato is not baked in: the engine can add 5-6 Hz pitch vibrato (10-20 cents) after ~0.3 s. Recommended release 0.15 s.",
